Item_4_Comment:
 All analyses were conducted in R, using the metafor package (
R Development Core Team, 2022
).

Item_5_Comment:
Our review included 25 studies, of which 17 met the inclusion criteria for the meta-analysis (
Fig. 1
)

Item_10_Comment:
Upon visual inspection of funnel plots and Egger's test, indications of potential publication bias were found for FEV1 and FVC (
Supplemental Figs. 1-2
).
